ps://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/11256","id":146180145,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE0NjE4MDE0NQ==","user":{"login":"xchardon","id":5244229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDQyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5244229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon","html_url":"https://github.com/xchardon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-10-07T12:21:32Z","updated_at":"2015-10-07T12:21:32Z","body":"Here is a minimal example:\n\n``` python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith open('testfwf.txt', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(\"Text contained in the file header\\n\")\n    f.write(\"\\n\")\n    f.write(\"DataCol1   DataCol2\\n\")\n    f.write(\"     0.0        1.0\\n\")\n    f.write(\"   101.6      956.1\\n\")\n\nskiprows = 2\n\nprint(\"Using the read_fwf function simply:\")\ndf = pd.read_fwf('testfwf.txt', skiprows = skiprows)\nprint(list(df))\n\nprint(\"Manually skipping the text lines before using read_fwf:\")\nwith open('testfwf.txt', 'r') as f:\n    for i in range(skiprows):\n        f.readline()\n    df = pd.read_fwf(f, encoding=\"utf8\")\n    print(list(df))\n```\n\nIt gives the following result:\n\n```\nUsing the read_fwf function simply:\n['DataCol1   DataCol2', 'Unnamed: 1', 'Unnamed: 2']\nManually skipping the text lines before using read_fwf:\n['DataCol1', 'DataCol2']\n```\n\nI'm using Python 3.4.3 and pandas 0.16.2\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/comments/146180145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"xchardon","id":5244229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDQyMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5244229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon","html_url":"https://github.com/xchardon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xchardon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/comments/146340790","html_url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/11256#issuecomment-146340790","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/11256","id":146340790,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE0NjM0MDc5MA==","user":{"login":"jreback","id":953992,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1Mzk5Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/953992?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback","html_url":"https://github.com/jreback","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jreback/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http